<main class="section narrow"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Kontodaten</span><h1>Mein Profil</h1></div><a class="btn" href="/konto">Zurück</a></div><section class="card admin-form"><h2>Stammdaten</h2><form method="post" action="/konto/profil" class="form-grid"><?=App\Core\Csrf::field()?><label>Vorname<input name="first_name" value="<?=App\Core\View::e($seller['first_name'])?>" required></label><label>Nachname<input name="last_name" value="<?=App\Core\View::e($seller['last_name'])?>" required></label><label class="full">Straße und Hausnummer<input name="street" value="<?=App\Core\View::e($seller['street'])?>" required></label><label>PLZ<input name="postal_code" value="<?=App\Core\View::e($seller['postal_code'])?>" required></label><label>Ort<input name="city" value="<?=App\Core\View::e($seller['city'])?>" required></label><label class="full">Telefonnummer<input name="phone" value="<?=App\Core\View::e($seller['phone'])?>" required></label><button class="btn primary full">Speichern</button></form></section><section class="card admin-form"><h2>E-Mail-Adresse</h2><p class="muted">Nach einer Änderung muss die neue Adresse erneut bestätigt werden. Bis dahin können keine neuen Aufträge angenommen werden.</p><form method="post" action="/konto/profil/email" class="form-grid"><?=App\Core\Csrf::field()?><label class="full">E-Mail<input name="email" type="email" value="<?=App\Core\View::e($seller['email'])?>" required></label><button class="btn primary full">E-Mail ändern</button></form></section><div class="notice">Eine Kontolöschung kann nur durch den Betreiber durchgeführt werden.</div></main>